    {
      "id": "C01-02",
      "subtitles_zh": "这期把镜头放在行军、补给和损耗。核心问题是，怎样把足够多的兵，在合适的时间，以能够继续作战的状态送到战场。先读原版界面，再跟着真实变化看结果。下令成功、预计抵达和真正到场，要分别确认。",
      "subtitles_en": "This episode follows marching, supply, and attrition. How do we bring enough soldiers to the battlefield, at the right time, ready to keep fighting? First, read the base game's interface. Then follow the actual changes. A successful order, predicted arrival, and actual arrival need separate checks.",
