    {
      "id": "C01-04",
      "subtitles_zh": "先看三个已经观察到的区别。有一支军队，补给回到三百，人数却还差一个；另一轮独立观察里，它真的补上了那一个。还有两军合并，兵团一个没少，补给却不是把两份库存直接相加。人数、库存、容量和组织变化，需要分开读。",
      "subtitles_en": "Start with three differences we have already observed. One army recovered to 300 supply while still missing one soldier. In a separate observation, that soldier was actually reinforced. Two armies also merged without losing any regiments, but their supplies were not simply added together. Soldier count, supply stock, capacity, and army organization each need their own reading.",
