      "subtitles_en": "Finally, we will compare three plans: march as one army, split to recover and reunite, or take another route. Each needs a separate replay from the same starting point, comparing actual arrival, strength, supply, and payments. One unsuitable recovery location does not mean the entire split-army plan has lost. We will not choose a winner before the results are complete.",
